					Plu.
					2.676b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέξις δ. τὸ στόμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hermog.
					<u>Id.</u>
					1.6
